      "side": 1,
      "message": "could all of this be replaced by something like this: (untested)\n\nstatic long getMaxFileSize(FileDescriptor fd) {\n    File file \u003d ParcelFileDescriptor.getFile(fd);\n    long result \u003d new StatFs(file.getCanonicalPath()).getAvailableBytes();\n    Context ctx \u003d (Context)ActivityThread.currentApplication();\n    StorageManager sm \u003d (StorageManager)ctx.getSystemService(Context.STORAGE_SERVICE);\n    StorageVolume vol \u003d sm.getStorageVolume(file);\n    long maxFileSizeBytes \u003d vol.getMaxFileSize();\n    if (maxFileSizeBytes \u003e 0) {\n        result \u003d Math.min(result, maxFileSizeBytes);\n    }\n    return result;\n}",
